PROVENANCE "Hand-written from S1OwnerExpectations RT-05, ReviewReducerTest, and the existing React review contract."

EXAMPLES countsCorrect
  id                         | reviewRating | reviewHasTypedResult | reviewTypedCorrect -> expected
  oral-again                 | again  | false          | false        -> false
  oral-hard                  | hard   | false          | false        -> true
  oral-good                  | good   | false          | false        -> true
  oral-easy                  | easy   | false          | false        -> true
  typed-correct-again        | again  | true           | true         -> true
  typed-wrong-good           | good   | true           | false        -> false
  typed-wrong-again          | again  | true           | false        -> false
  absent-ignores-placeholder | good   | false          | false        -> true
